  "content": "[D#5]\n[F5]\n\n[Verse I]\nTell the tears\nThey arn't what you need\nTell the wounds\nThey cannot bleed [E5]\nWatch them stumble\nYou watch and see\nHow they released\n[A5]THE DEMONS IN ME [B5][D5]\n\n[Chorus I]\nTHERE'S NO WAY TO GO BACK\n\n[Break I]\n\n[Verse II]\nHear the ghosts\nThey walk the halls\nFeel their presence\nIn the walls\nBeyond the reach\nOf human range\nA drop of hell [F#5]\nA touch of strange\nThe ellipse [G5]\nAccross all time\nDefies the reason\nDefies the rhyme\n\n[Chorus II]\nTHERE'S NO WAY TO GO BACK\n\n[Bridge]\nPulls you in\nAt first you feel\nNothing more than safe\n\n[Outro]\n\n[Vocal Fade]",
